msgstr "Horizontal"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1000
msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "Vertikal"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1029
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "Tombol"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1033 blocks/__init__.py:3191 blocks/__init__.py:3284
#: site_settings.py:572
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Tata letak"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1035
msgid ""
"Horizontal lays buttons out in centered rows. Vertical stacks them in a "
"centered column."
msgstr ""
"Horizontal menata tombol dalam baris yang terpusat. Vertikal menumpuknya "
"dalam kolom yang terpusat."

#: blocks/__init__.py:1050
msgid "Button Group"
msgstr "Grup tombol"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1053
msgid ""
"Two or more call-to-action buttons, laid out horizontally or vertically. Use "
"the single Button block instead for one CTA."
msgstr ""
"Dua tombol ajakan bertindak atau lebih, ditata secara horizontal atau "
"vertikal. Gunakan blok Tombol jika hanya ada satu ajakan bertindak."

#: blocks/__init__.py:1067 blocks/__init__.py:1225
#: templates/wtrx/components/card.html:90
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Pelajari lebih lanjut"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1105 validators.py:75
msgid ""
"This HTML appears to have mismatched or unclosed tags — check that every "
"opening tag has a matching closing tag."
msgstr ""
"HTML ini tampaknya memiliki tag yang tidak berpasangan atau belum ditutup — "
"periksa bahwa setiap tag pembuka memiliki tag penutup."

#: blocks/__init__.py:1114
msgid "Custom embed"
msgstr "Kode khusus"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1120
msgid ""
"Paste in HTML supplied by another service -- an embed, a widget, a snippet "
"of markup. It is rendered exactly as given, so only use it for code you "
"trust. Tag balance is validated on save; markup safety is not."
msgstr ""
"Tempelkan HTML yang disediakan layanan lain: sematan, widget, atau potongan "
"markup. Ditampilkan persis seperti yang diberikan, jadi gunakan hanya untuk "
"kode yang tepercaya. Keseimbangan tag diperiksa saat menyimpan; keamanan "
"markup tidak."

#: blocks/__init__.py:1148
msgid "Table"
msgstr "Tabel"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1151
msgid ""
"A simple data table, edited as a spreadsheet-style grid. The first row and "
"column can each be marked as headers."
msgstr ""
"Tabel data sederhana yang disunting seperti lembar kerja. Baris pertama dan "
"kolom pertama masing-masing dapat ditandai sebagai kepala tabel."

#: blocks/__init__.py:1194
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "Label"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1195
msgid ""
"Optional short label displayed as a pill above the heading (e.g. 'Global')."
msgstr ""
"Label singkat opsional yang ditampilkan sebagai pil di atas judul (misalnya "
"“Global”)."

#: blocks/__init__.py:1199 site_settings.py:1184
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Ikon"

#: blocks/__init__.py:1201
msgid ""
"Optional small icon image (ideally square) displayed beside the content."
msgstr ""
"Gambar ikon kecil opsional (sebaiknya persegi) yang ditampilkan di samping "
"konten."

